---
title: "borrow (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: ensure_version_matches + validate_market
    q_validate --> q_check_circuit: assert !circuit_break_triggered
    q_check_circuit --> q_check_amount: assert borrow_amount != 0
    q_check_amount --> q_check_pause: assert !borrow_paused
    q_check_pause --> q_load_config: load min_borrow, max_borrow from asset_config
    q_load_config --> q_check_obligation: assert obligation.market_id matches
    q_check_obligation --> q_rate_limit: emode.borrow_limiter.add_outflow(now, amount)
    q_rate_limit --> q_refresh_interest: refresh_obligation_borrow_interest(now)
    q_refresh_interest --> q_try_borrow: obligation.try_borrow_asset(amount, borrow_index)
    q_try_borrow --> q_check_no_collateral: assert coin_type not in obligation.ctokens
    q_check_no_collateral --> q_check_min: enforce_post_borrow_repay_invariant(min_borrow)
    q_check_min --> q_update_emode: emode_group.update_asset_borrow(old, new)
    q_update_emode --> q_check_emode_limit: assert emode_total_borrow lte emode_max
    q_check_emode_limit --> q_safety_check: is_obligation_safe(debts vs collateral)
    q_safety_check --> q_reserve_borrow: reserve.borrow_amount(amount)
    q_reserve_borrow --> q_check_reserve: assert cash - cash_reserve gt amount
    q_check_reserve --> q_check_market_limit: assert total_debt lte asset_max_borrow
    q_check_market_limit --> q_update_mining: update_obligation_reward_manager(borrow_type)
    q_update_mining --> q_emit: emit BorrowEvent
    q_emit --> q_return: return Coin from balance
    q_return --> [*]

    note right of q_try_borrow
        INV-001: Cannot borrow an asset deposited as collateral by same obligation
        INV-002: debt_amount must be gte min_borrow_amount after borrow
        INV-003: emode group total borrow must not exceed emode max_borrow_amount
        INV-004: obligation must remain safe (weighted_debts lte collateral_value)
        INV-005: reserve must have sufficient liquidity (cash - reserve gt borrow)
        INV-006: borrow_index tracks compound interest accumulation
    end note
